# SEO

- New pages must ship with full SEO: unique title, meta description, canonical, robots, Open Graph, Twitter cards, favicon/manifest, and appropriate JSON-LD.
- When page content changes (services, products, prices, copy, images, contact, hours, location), update related SEO and `sitemap.xml` in the same change.
- Base URL: `https://www.slmgardens.co.uk`. Use Lakeside, Swindon in titles/descriptions where natural.
- Order/enquire param pages: `noindex, follow`; canonical to the parent category page.
- Keep plain `.html` links (e.g. `planters.html`) so the site works without a local server.
